},{"end":94.4800033569336,"text":"Sometimes I think you don't know who you are","start":89.5},{"end":101.86000061035156,"text":"I'm here to tell you more than you think","start":98.04000091552734},{"end":108.62000274658203,"text":"It's like a piece of a whole which I have so sprinkled over the galaxy and the stars","start":101.86000061035156},{"end":115.62000274658203,"text":"The wrongs and the lights, you find your place there and you don't find it","start":108.62000274658203},{"end":125.0199966430664,"text":"To me all you can be is a lie and there's a fracture of us","start":116.16000366210938},{"end":129.39999389648438,"text":"I know there's a better way","start":125.0199966430664},{"end":134.9600067138672,"text":"I know you'll find that brighter day","start":129.55999755859375},{"end":140.6199951171875,"text":"As for me, I gotta hop the road over there","start":134.9600067138672},{"end":143.66000366210938,"text":"Find my start and be better from my heart","start":140.6199951171875},{"end":147.55999755859375,"text":"And I'm gonna do it for me and I'll be me","start":143.66000366210938},{"end":153.6199951171875,"text":"Can you be you and we'll find happiness somewhere else again?","start":147.55999755859375},{"end":155.74000549316406,"text":"That's just the way it goes, I'm sorry","start":154.32000732421875},{"end":158,"text":"It's time to be free then","start":155.94000244140625},{"end":160.5399932861328,"text":"It's time to be us again","start":158},{"end":165.5399932861328,"text":"Be all you can be","start":162.27999877929688}],"unlock":{"card":"card-41","fragments":10},"chartVersion":"v6_deluxe","chartReport":{"version":"v6_deluxe","bpm":107.9,"catalogBpm":108,"tempoConfidence":0.99,"beats":303,"bars":75,"repeatedBars":32,"povTimes":[58.305,133.886],"typeCounts":{"swipe":13,"tap":305,"hold":16,"lift":29,"hold-swipe":15,"accent":3,"mine":18,"slide":5,"break":4,"remix":2},"ms":289},"deluxe":true,"timingProfile":"elite"}